No, ^T will work if you had quaff a potion of speed. Do not teleport
to a straight line with the 'u', it will scare it away. Instead, go off
one line from the 'u'. The next turn 'u' will move, but it will not
teleport away. After it's turn, you got 2 turns before 'u' will move
again. The first move, line up with the 'u', the second move, throw a gem
at it.

